              "value": "Sacrifice Armor"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: The scrapborn is damaged by an attack dealing physical damage\n\nThe scrapborn directs the damage to one of the pieces of scrap attached to its body and gains resistance 15 against the triggering attack, but its AC is lowered by 2 for 24 hours. The scrapborn's AC cannot be reduced below 16 in this way."
